contentText:
After all that they&#8217;ve been through, Gwen Stefani and Gavin Rossdale are cool &#8212; at least, cool enough to reunite to support their son Kingston at his recent concert, with the No Doubt frontwoman attending with husband Blake Shelton at her side.

The three musicians were all in the audience Tuesday night at The Troubadour in West Hollywood, California, as Stefani and Rossdale&#8217;s eldest son rocked out onstage, according to photos circulating online. TMZ also shared video of Shelton and his fellow The Voice coaching alum holding hands as they left the venue, with Stefani at one point saying goodbye to her parents before getting into her car.

